/T (Tattva is the bridge between East and West. An exploration of transformation. A story of metamorphosis. Amber Bosteels and Arnaud Soetens translate Shiva in the form of Nataraja, dancing the universe into motion. The destroyer of the old, making way for the new to emerge. The line between masculine and feminine, the contrast between grounded and cosmic, the yogi, deep in the mountains.)
/E (Tattva is the bridge between East and West. An exploration of transformation. A story of metamorphosis. Amber Bosteels and Arnaud Soetens translate Shiva in the form of Nataraja, dancing the universe into motion. The destroyer of the old, making way for the new to emerge. The line between masculine and feminine, the contrast between grounded and cosmic, the yogi, deep in the mountains.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [1]
>>
