90 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/P 76 0 R
/T (With a nod to 2026, they weave classical Indian and contemporary dance and music into a pulsating symbiosis that embraces the structure of chaos and intention. The piece hypnotises the viewer, inviting them to feel and reconnect with the deep roots of our existence, to recognise the cycles and nuance the forms of our identities. Tattva discovers the energy of Shiva: everything and nothing, the beginning and the end. Shiva is us.)
/E (With a nod to 2026, they weave classical Indian and contemporary dance and music into a pulsating symbiosis that embraces the structure of chaos and intention. The piece hypnotises the viewer, inviting them to feel and reconnect with the deep roots of our existence, to recognise the cycles and nuance the forms of our identities. Tattva discovers the energy of Shiva: everything and nothing, the beginning and the end. Shiva is us.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [2]
>>
