93 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 77 0 R
/E (A vision can easily tend towards the grand, yet all the more essential is the courage to voice our dreams. Our art is a gateway to our own well-being, but also to that of our society. A mirror of our inner world. By awakening all our senses through dance, music, words and stage, we hope to set off small chain reactions in consciousness. In the softness and beauty of creation, we weave the cocoon in which we all long to be. A connection that begins from within. From an essence, Tattva, rooted in Eastern mysticism and philosophy, gently whispering towards the West. Tattva is a reflection of who we are. A way of seeing and thinking that we wish to share without imposing it. Change is found in slowness.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
94 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 77 0 R
/E (Tattva is a seed that has been planted, one we have been nurturing and cultivating over the past two years. A project that, at its core, can take many forms and remains open to collaboration and further exploration.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [3]
>>
