/E (Amber Bosteels is a dancer, teacher and choreographer. At the age of eight, she discovered her passion for Indian dance, which continues to inspire her to this day. At eighteen, she moved to Leeds, where she trained for three years at the Northern School of Contemporary Dance.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
98 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 78 0 R
/E (After graduating, she began working as a freelance dancer and maker, developing a practice rooted between Belgium and India. She creates and performs work that weaves contemporary and Indian dance forms together. She has performed with various companies and created her own work, including Jumping over the Zebra Stripes, Hans and Tattva.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
99 0 obj
<<
