/P 78 0 R
/E (Alongside her work as a performer, Amber shares her love of movement through both dance and yoga, with a focus on improvisation, playful movement, body awareness and imagination. In Ghent, she co-coordinates the movement platform DEVLOER and works as a camera operator for dance and theatre performances with Beeldstorm.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [4]
>>
